      </solution>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="176" has_solution="false">
      <problem>
        <p>$$\frac{3}{5m^{2} - 3m - 2},\frac{6m}{5m^{2} + 17m + 6}$$</p>
      </problem>
    </exercise>
    <instruction>In the following exercises, write as equivalent rational expressions with the given LCD.</instruction>
    <exercise number="177" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <p>$$\frac{5}{x^{2} - 2x - 8},\frac{2x}{x^{2} - x - 12}$$LCD $$(x - 4)(x + 2)(x + 3)$$</p>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <p>$$\frac{5x + 15}{(x - 4)(x + 2)(x + 3)},$$



$$\frac{2x^{2} + 4x}{(x - 4)(x + 2)(x + 3)}$$</p>
      </solution>
